Gently toss together @hard boiled eggs{2}(quartered), @avocado{1/2%large}(chopped), @red onion{1%heaping tablespoon}(finely chopped) and @red bell pepper{1%heaping tablespoon}(finely chopped) in a #bowl{}.

Add a drizzle of @white balsamic vinegar{drizzle} and @extra virgin olive oil{drizzle} and sprinkle on @flaky sea salt{to taste} and @fresh cracked pepper{to taste}.

Add @crushed red pepper{to taste} if desired.

Serve and enjoy with a #fork{}!